<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= lang || 'id' %>">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Final System Audit | <%= company %></title>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f172a">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/admin/manifest.webmanifest">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">
  <style>
    .audit-pass { color:#10b981; font-weight:700; }
    .audit-warn { color:#fbbf24; font-weight:700; }
    .audit-fail { color:#ef4444; font-weight:700; }
    .audit-info { color:#38bdf8; font-weight:700; }
    .audit-big { font-size:26px; font-weight:800; margin:0; }
    .overall-released { background:#10b981; color:#052e16; }
    .overall-dev { background:#fbbf24; color:#1f1300; }
    .overall-blocked { background:#ef4444; color:#2a0a0a; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/sidebar', { activePage: 'final_audit', company }) %>
<div class="mw">
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="tb-title">
      <button class="hb-menu" onclick="toggleSidebar()"><i class="bi bi-list"></i></button>
      <i class="bi bi-clipboard-check"></i> Final System Audit
    </div>
    <div class="tb-right"><span class="adm-badge"><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> Admin</span><a href="/admin/logout" class="btn btn-g btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-left"></i> Logout</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="page">

    <div class="card mb16 <%= overall === 'READY FOR RELEASE' ? 'overall-released' : overall === 'BLOCKED' ? 'overall-blocked' : 'overall-dev' %>" style="border-radius:14px; padding:18px;">
      <h4 class="audit-big">DAFFIYANET — FINAL SYSTEM AUDIT</h4>
      <div style="font-size:15px; margin-top:6px;">Status: <strong><%= overall %></strong></div>
      <div style="font-size:14px;">PASS: <strong><%= pass %></strong> · WARNING: <strong><%= warn %></strong> · FAIL: <strong><%= fail %></strong> · INFO: <strong><%= info %></strong> · TOTAL: <strong><%= results.length %></strong></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb16">
      <div class="card-hd"><h6 style="margin:0"><i class="bi bi-clipboard-check"></i> Hasil Pemeriksaan (dari kenyataan langsung)</h6></div>
      <div class="card-bd" style="overflow:auto">
        <table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:12px">
          <thead>
            <tr><th style="text-align:left">Kategori</th><th style="text-align:left">Item</th><th style="text-align:left">Status</th><th style="text-align:left">Detail</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% results.forEach(r => { %>
              <tr>
                <td><%= r.cat %></td>
                <td><%= r.item %></td>
                <td>
                  <% if (r.status === 'PASS') { %><span class="audit-pass">🟢 PASS</span><% } else if (r.status === 'WARNING') { %><span class="audit-warn">🟡 WARNING</span><% } else if (r.status === 'FAIL') { %><span class="audit-fail">🔴 FAIL</span><% } else { %><span class="audit-info">ℹ️ <%= r.status %></span><% } %>
                </td>
                <td><%= r.detail %></td>
              </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb16">
      <div class="card-hd"><h6 style="margin:0"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> Catatan</h6></div>
      <div class="card-bd" style="color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; line-height:1.6;">
        <p>Halaman ini membaca kondisi database, file, layanan, MikroTik & link merchant secara langsung — bukan data dummy.</p>
        <p>Apabila masih ada 🔴 FAIL atau 🟡 WARNING (selain WhatsApp bot yang memang belum terhubung), perbaiki dulu sebelum release.</p>
        <p>Backup terakhir: <code><%= 'billing.db.bak-paymentlink-2026-11-16' %></code></p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
